# camtrap poller — its own cron file, deliberately not mixed into anyone else's.
# Install as /etc/cron.d/camtrap-poll (root:root 644). Replace `piuser` with the unprivileged
# user that owns the token file.
#
# Every minute. The spec left the interval open (section 10, item 3); two minutes was tried before
# the first live run, and a two-minute wait for the photo of someone in your room reads as the
# system not working. One ssh per minute is cheap.
* * * * * piuser /usr/local/bin/camtrap-poll.sh
